     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Unfortunately, there was another bug in <span style=\"font-family:&quot;courier new&quot;,monospace\">find_peaks()</span>, and so I&#39;ve had to release yet another version of R/qtl2 (version 0.12).</div><div><br></div><div>To update, use:</div><div><br></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    update.packages(repos=&quot;<a href=\"https://rqtl.org/qtl2cran\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rqtl.org/qtl2cran&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496809436000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2hI1bJSALyAXcuakU_v-2l\">https://rqtl.org/qtl2cran</a>&quot;)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Or install from scratch:</font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    install.packages(&quot;qtl2&quot;, </font><span style=\"font-family:&quot;courier new&quot;,monospace\">repos=&quot;<a href=\"https://rqtl.org/qtl2cran\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rqtl.org/qtl2cran&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496809436000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2hI1bJSALyAXcuakU_v-2l\">https://rqtl.org/qtl2cran</a>&quot;)</span><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font><div><br></div><div>karl</div></div><div><br></div></div>"
